## Quick start

[code lang=bash title="Install"
pip install minidoc-dsl
]

[code lang=bash title="Compile"
minidoc report.minidoc -o report.html
]

[code lang=python title="Python API"
from minidoc import compile_to_html

html = compile_to_html(dsl_string)
]

[divider]

## MCP server — for Claude and LLM agents

Add to your `.mcp.json` — no cloning, no setup, no venv:

[code lang=json title=".mcp.json"
{
  "mcpServers": {
    "minidoc": {
      "type": "stdio",
      "command": "uvx",
      "args": ["minidoc-mcp"]
    }
  }
}
]

[table cols="Tool,Description"
  render_and_open(dsl) | Compile DSL → HTML, save, open in browser
  render_minidoc(dsl)  | Compile DSL → HTML, return file path
  minidoc_guide prompt | Load full DSL reference into model context
]

[divider]

## Frontend stack

[table cols="Layer,Library"
  CSS              | Pico CSS v2 — classless, CSS-variable theming
  Charts           | Chart.js
  Diagrams         | Mermaid.js v11
  Syntax highlight | highlight.js — github-dark theme
]

[alert type=success text="All libraries loaded from CDN. Compiled HTML is fully self-contained — open in any browser, share as an attachment."]
